.TH GRID_RENDER_SCROLLBAR 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_render_scrollbar \- A track along the window's right edge, w pixels wide, with a thumb showing where the window sits in the list
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "void grid_render_scrollbar(const Grid *g, float w);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A track along the window's right edge, w pixels wide, with a thumb showing where the window sits in the list. Draws nothing when every row already fits, so it is safe to call unconditionally.
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_render (3),
.BR grid_max_scroll (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
